(5035666, 733772, 83313, '<td valign="top">No vote from me, since I know whose this is. If I were voting on this however, I think I would give it a 6, maybe a 7. I like the colors, leading composition, and the appearance of the reflection. I think some may not care for the strong, obvious HDR look, and most of your low votes will probably be coming from that aspect of the shot. I expect this to do reasonably well, however. Glad you chose to enter this one.</td>', 'No vote from me, since I know whose this is. If I were voting on this however, I think I would give it a 6, maybe a 7. I like the colors, leading composition, and the appearance of the reflection. I think some may not care for the strong, obvious HDR look, and most of your low votes will probably be coming from that aspect of the shot. I expect this to do reasonably well, however. Glad you chose to enter this one.', '2008-11-01 01:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
