(5036163, 733740, 65234, '<td valign="top">Quite a scenic vista.  The actual person is getting a little lost in the trees.  You might try a 2nd layer with a bit of blur, erase the person and the parasail from the layer, then merge/flatten with some degree of opacity so the effect of the blur is enough to bring the subject out without drastically altering the overall shot.</td>', 'Quite a scenic vista.  The actual person is getting a little lost in the trees.  You might try a 2nd layer with a bit of blur, erase the person and the parasail from the layer, then merge/flatten with some degree of opacity so the effect of the blur is enough to bring the subject out without drastically altering the overall shot.', '2008-11-01 09:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
