(5036508, 733372, 97114, '<td valign="top">I am generally not drawn to this type of picture, but I really like the way he almost is "lost" in the wall.  The photo really portrays a sense of hopelessness.  Well done.</td>', 'I am generally not drawn to this type of picture, but I really like the way he almost is "lost" in the wall.  The photo really portrays a sense of hopelessness.  Well done.', '2008-11-01 11:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
