(5037113, 735288, 94265, '<td valign="top">The hair and eyes are lovely. The sunset light coupled with her make-up has caused her face to be a tad orange, I''d lower the red or orange hue channel to make her skin tone look a bit more natural. The use of DOF on her body is effective. I also think your perspective, being there on the ground beside her as opposed to looking down, is a really good choice.</td>', 'The hair and eyes are lovely. The sunset light coupled with her make-up has caused her face to be a tad orange, I''d lower the red or orange hue channel to make her skin tone look a bit more natural. The use of DOF on her body is effective. I also think your perspective, being there on the ground beside her as opposed to looking down, is a really good choice.', '2008-11-01 19:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037117, 733216, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lovely scenery, the different balloons offer nicely colourful points of interest. I actually also think this would be a gorgeous landscape shot without the balloons.</td>', 'Lovely scenery, the different balloons offer nicely colourful points of interest. I actually also think this would be a gorgeous landscape shot without the balloons.', '2008-11-01 19:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037118, 730998, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you''re allowed to show genitalia on DPC, maybe your monitor isn''t fully calibrated but I can see everything. The nudity is a wee bit in-your-face but I love the twisting pose of her body. Nice focus on the water droplets.</td>', 'I don''t think you''re allowed to show genitalia on DPC, maybe your monitor isn''t fully calibrated but I can see everything. The nudity is a wee bit in-your-face but I love the twisting pose of her body. Nice focus on the water droplets.', '2008-11-01 19:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
