(5037122, 735310, 108248, '<td valign="top">awesome, ah the power of nature</td>', 'awesome, ah the power of nature', '2008-11-01 19:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037123, 731697, 97166, '<td valign="top">They settled into their seats, and whispers of awe and excitement drifted through the crowd in hushed waves.  They''d waited weeks for this moment, this escape from the dullness of the usual classroom day.  Parents and students alike gasped as the lights went off, and the machine projected its display on the ceiling. <br/> <br/>"My God, it''s full of stars!" was heard from some joker, and nervous laughter was heard.<br/> <br/>It wasn''t long, however, before the laughter and the whispers and the exclamations began to stop.  It wasn''t long before the joking reference to an old film was suddenly not so much of a joke after all.  <br/> <br/>It wasn''t long before everyone in the room was lost forever.  It was, indeed, full of stars.</td>', 'They settled into their seats, and whispers of awe and excitement drifted through the crowd in hushed waves.  They''d waited weeks for this moment, this escape from the dullness of the usual classroom day.  Parents and students alike gasped as the lights went off, and the machine projected its display on the ceiling.  "My God, it''s full of stars!" was heard from some joker, and nervous laughter was heard. It wasn''t long, however, before the laughter and the whispers and the exclamations began to stop.  It wasn''t long before the joking reference to an old film was suddenly not so much of a joke after all.   It wasn''t long before everyone in the room was lost forever.  It was, indeed, full of stars.', '2008-11-01 19:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037126, 734797, 108248, '<td valign="top">where was this taken??? absolutely breathtaking</td>', 'where was this taken??? absolutely breathtaking', '2008-11-01 19:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037131, 735105, 97166, '<td valign="top">The concert seemed to be dying a slow and painful death, and when Philbert grabbed Norman, Norman''s squawk nearly destroyed the performance for good.  However, within moments, Philbert began to play Norman, like he was a cello.  The sweet, sweet music that resulted awed everyone, and Philbert''s quick thinking was hailed as legendary.</td>', 'The concert seemed to be dying a slow and painful death, and when Philbert grabbed Norman, Norman''s squawk nearly destroyed the performance for good.  However, within moments, Philbert began to play Norman, like he was a cello.  The sweet, sweet music that resulted awed everyone, and Philbert''s quick thinking was hailed as legendary.', '2008-11-01 19:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037142, 735253, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery! I hope we get some snow in Scotland this Winter, thanks to global warming we''ve barely even had slush on the ground the past few years. I like the perspective on this, close enough to the boat and stile to get details but also showing off that impressive while landscape. Very attractive.</td>', 'Beautiful scenery! I hope we get some snow in Scotland this Winter, thanks to global warming we''ve barely even had slush on the ground the past few years. I like the perspective on this, close enough to the boat and stile to get details but also showing off that impressive while landscape. Very attractive.', '2008-11-01 19:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037143, 735411, 94265, '<td valign="top">Kinda trippy! Good perspective, leads the eye nicely. Love the little bits of blue in some of the windows.</td>', 'Kinda trippy! Good perspective, leads the eye nicely. Love the little bits of blue in some of the windows.', '2008-11-01 19:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037150, 732596, 94265, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus/sharpness, the details are fantastic. Very pretty kitty too.</td>', 'Excellent focus/sharpness, the details are fantastic. Very pretty kitty too.', '2008-11-01 19:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037151, 735276, 75585, '<td valign="top">I wish he was looking at you but I love the color of his eyes.</td>', 'I wish he was looking at you but I love the color of his eyes.', '2008-11-01 19:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037155, 735399, 75585, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing on the barn</td>', 'Excellent framing on the barn', '2008-11-01 19:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037158, 733323, 75585, '<td valign="top">I wish the horizon was level on this but I imagine you were attempting to keep your surfer upright but it just doesn''t work for me having the horizon so far out of whack.  Absolutely phenomenally gorgeous colors on this.</td>', 'I wish the horizon was level on this but I imagine you were attempting to keep your surfer upright but it just doesn''t work for me having the horizon so far out of whack.  Absolutely phenomenally gorgeous colors on this.', '2008-11-01 19:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037161, 733295, 94265, '<td valign="top">I really love the spotlighting on him. I would have moved some of those leaves though, especially the one obstructing his face. I understand though that his eyes may not have been in the most attractive condition, since the eyes start to degrade quicker than their bodies. Anyway, the leaves do bring a wee bit of colour to the shot. I love the title, very poetic.</td>', 'I really love the spotlighting on him. I would have moved some of those leaves though, especially the one obstructing his face. I understand though that his eyes may not have been in the most attractive condition, since the eyes start to degrade quicker than their bodies. Anyway, the leaves do bring a wee bit of colour to the shot. I love the title, very poetic.', '2008-11-01 19:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037174, 734933, 94265, '<td valign="top">I think the shot would''ve been fine without the vignette. The crop is maybe a touch tight on the bottom. I love the idea itself and the blue theme works well, especially with that bright blue sky.</td>', 'I think the shot would''ve been fine without the vignette. The crop is maybe a touch tight on the bottom. I love the idea itself and the blue theme works well, especially with that bright blue sky.', '2008-11-01 20:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037179, 734789, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not normally impressed with pet portraits generally but this is really pretty. Photographing her/him in the garden provides an attractive, interesting setting, as opposed to a blank background and shot of only the face. The colours of the flowers are lovely too.</td>', 'I''m not normally impressed with pet portraits generally but this is really pretty. Photographing her/him in the garden provides an attractive, interesting setting, as opposed to a blank background and shot of only the face. The colours of the flowers are lovely too.', '2008-11-01 20:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037194, 733118, 94265, '<td valign="top">Extra point for making me laugh! Hehe I love that title, it fits him so well. Lovely shot, the colours really stand out nicely amongst the leaves.</td>', 'Extra point for making me laugh! Hehe I love that title, it fits him so well. Lovely shot, the colours really stand out nicely amongst the leaves.', '2008-11-01 20:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037196, 731700, 97166, '<td valign="top">She stood there, proudly displaying her dexterity, her tiny feet perched precariously on the ledge, her hands gripping her lifeline.  Sure, to someone bigger, the drop was insignificant.  Sure, to someone with more experience in life, the achievement wouldn''t be worth noting.<br/> <br/>  To her, however, shining in the light of the morning, facing the shadows of the uncertainty of the future, it was a monumental moment.  Climbing to that small but significant perch, showing off her growing abilities. <br/> <br/>She stood there, proudly, and so she should.</td>', 'She stood there, proudly displaying her dexterity, her tiny feet perched precariously on the ledge, her hands gripping her lifeline.  Sure, to someone bigger, the drop was insignificant.  Sure, to someone with more experience in life, the achievement wouldn''t be worth noting.   To her, however, shining in the light of the morning, facing the shadows of the uncertainty of the future, it was a monumental moment.  Climbing to that small but significant perch, showing off her growing abilities.  She stood there, proudly, and so she should.', '2008-11-01 20:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
