(5037217, 733055, 97166, '<td valign="top">As a sudden loss of pressure caused Johnathan to look up, he watched in horror as a part of the tree before him was disintegrated silently, and four dark beams of energy traced a path through the sky.  Soon after, the beams gone to whatever destination they were bound to, a sudden boom accompanied the filling in of space that had been emptied in their wake.  <br/> <br/>Johnathan fell to the ground, grabbing at his ears as his eardrums popped from the pressure and sound.  He screamed into the earth in his pain, and so didn''t see the following beams that obliterated him, and almost everything around.<br/> <br/>It had begun.</td>', 'As a sudden loss of pressure caused Johnathan to look up, he watched in horror as a part of the tree before him was disintegrated silently, and four dark beams of energy traced a path through the sky.  Soon after, the beams gone to whatever destination they were bound to, a sudden boom accompanied the filling in of space that had been emptied in their wake.   Johnathan fell to the ground, grabbing at his ears as his eardrums popped from the pressure and sound.  He screamed into the earth in his pain, and so didn''t see the following beams that obliterated him, and almost everything around. It had begun.', '2008-11-01 20:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
