(5037385, 735106, 97166, '<td valign="top">Spontaneous, innocent.   They kiss because they''ve seen their mommies and daddies do the same.  They kiss because they know, somewhere deep down, that it gets a reaction they enjoy.  They kiss because, on some level, they feel it''s good, and right, and beautiful.<br/> <br/>They kiss because they are learning, and growing, and finding out about themselves every day.  <br/> <br/>At the end of the kiss, she turns and smiles.  He turns with a slightly embarrassed grin.  They both turn back to their candy. <br/> <br/>The first steps always start with a tiny moment, and sometimes that moment is wonderful.</td>', 'Spontaneous, innocent.   They kiss because they''ve seen their mommies and daddies do the same.  They kiss because they know, somewhere deep down, that it gets a reaction they enjoy.  They kiss because, on some level, they feel it''s good, and right, and beautiful. They kiss because they are learning, and growing, and finding out about themselves every day.   At the end of the kiss, she turns and smiles.  He turns with a slightly embarrassed grin.  They both turn back to their candy.  The first steps always start with a tiny moment, and sometimes that moment is wonderful.', '2008-11-01 21:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037387, 733187, 97166, '<td valign="top">In a completely spontaneous moment, Geoffry does the Dance of the Egret, and wins the love of the beautiful Henrietta.  Sometimes it pays to do what someone least expects.</td>', 'In a completely spontaneous moment, Geoffry does the Dance of the Egret, and wins the love of the beautiful Henrietta.  Sometimes it pays to do what someone least expects.', '2008-11-01 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037392, 735301, 97166, '<td valign="top">As he crested the rise, he stopped and gasped.  After all these years, after all that time hunting, after all those endless miles searching, he had finally found it.  The discovery of a lifetime.  The archeological find that would put him on the map.<br/> <br/>He had found the Great Station Wagon Graveyard.</td>', 'As he crested the rise, he stopped and gasped.  After all these years, after all that time hunting, after all those endless miles searching, he had finally found it.  The discovery of a lifetime.  The archeological find that would put him on the map. He had found the Great Station Wagon Graveyard.', '2008-11-01 21:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
