(5038744, 735056, 75532, '<td valign="top">I watched a movie this week called Sunshine (//www.imdb.com/title/tt0448134/plotsummary) - about a team heading to the sun to deliver a ''payload''(some kind of atomb bomb or something) because our sun was dying and it would have been the end of life.  That movie made me appreciate how small we are.  This photo makes me appreciate how small my life is.  And why I should live each day like its my last day and make it better than the day before. 10</td>', 'I watched a movie this week called Sunshine (//www.imdb.com/title/tt0448134/plotsummary) - about a team heading to the sun to deliver a ''payload''(some kind of atomb bomb or something) because our sun was dying and it would have been the end of life.  That movie made me appreciate how small we are.  This photo makes me appreciate how small my life is.  And why I should live each day like its my last day and make it better than the day before. 10', '2008-11-02 12:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
