(5038931, 735255, 97166, '<td valign="top">Suzy started to feel a little strange as she walked along, heading home from work that day.  It seemed as if the very air around her was beginning to stretch, to distort.  She shook her head and grabbed at her temples, becoming disoriented.  With an effort she began to walk again, but suddenly, beyond all possibility, the very ground began to warp beneath her. The walls of the building she was passing began to bend in on themselves.  She stumbled, fear growing, and then screamed as someone ahead of her was sucked into the very fabric of space.<br/> <br/>As the walls and space around her continued to warp in on themselves, her very mind shattered, and so she was spared the horror of the ending of it all.</td>', 'Suzy started to feel a little strange as she walked along, heading home from work that day.  It seemed as if the very air around her was beginning to stretch, to distort.  She shook her head and grabbed at her temples, becoming disoriented.  With an effort she began to walk again, but suddenly, beyond all possibility, the very ground began to warp beneath her. The walls of the building she was passing began to bend in on themselves.  She stumbled, fear growing, and then screamed as someone ahead of her was sucked into the very fabric of space. As the walls and space around her continued to warp in on themselves, her very mind shattered, and so she was spared the horror of the ending of it all.', '2008-11-02 14:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
