(5039088, 734999, 97166, '<td valign="top">He came out of nowhere.  <br/> <br/>In his power wagon, armed with the destruction of worlds, cutting a path of mayhem and tomfoolery.  The unsuspecting were cut down viciously.  They were left dripping and frightened in his wake.<br/> <br/>He came out of nowhere. The elf. The helmeted menace. <br/> <br/>He came out of nowhere, and then, as quickly, he was gone.</td>', 'He came out of nowhere.   In his power wagon, armed with the destruction of worlds, cutting a path of mayhem and tomfoolery.  The unsuspecting were cut down viciously.  They were left dripping and frightened in his wake. He came out of nowhere. The elf. The helmeted menace.  He came out of nowhere, and then, as quickly, he was gone.', '2008-11-02 15:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
