(5040363, 733323, 33352, '<td valign="top">This photo has so much potential, IMHO a straight horizon would have brought the subject on the board onto a better perspective, as well as dodging the white foaming of the wave to make the surfer more visible, the colors are well done for the sunset, but the highlight in the background takes the viewer to the back of the photo before the subject can be seen, I am giving this a 7 for the technical requirements needed to take the shot, best of luck.</td>', 'This photo has so much potential, IMHO a straight horizon would have brought the subject on the board onto a better perspective, as well as dodging the white foaming of the wave to make the surfer more visible, the colors are well done for the sunset, but the highlight in the background takes the viewer to the back of the photo before the subject can be seen, I am giving this a 7 for the technical requirements needed to take the shot, best of luck.', '2008-11-03 04:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
