(5044203, 732310, 36382, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of detail in the water, which to me competes with the goose.  I think I''d rather see the goose pop out from the rest of the image, either by having the detail in the water a little bit blurry or something else.</td>', 'There is a lot of detail in the water, which to me competes with the goose.  I think I''d rather see the goose pop out from the rest of the image, either by having the detail in the water a little bit blurry or something else.', '2008-11-04 21:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
