(5045629, 735134, 27161, '<td valign="top">I think the difficulty with night shots is all the bloody noise.  I think it is better to darken the noisy areas and let the streaking light dominate the photo more, perhaps adjust bright-contrast. <br/> <br/>Also, I think the photo has a bit too much stuff in it.  If there is some way to get the streaks of light without the buildings on the left &amp; right (or by darkening them).  The sign distracts as well.<br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'I think the difficulty with night shots is all the bloody noise.  I think it is better to darken the noisy areas and let the streaking light dominate the photo more, perhaps adjust bright-contrast.  Also, I think the photo has a bit too much stuff in it.  If there is some way to get the streaks of light without the buildings on the left & right (or by darkening them).  The sign distracts as well. :)', '2008-11-05 05:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
