(5047661, 734182, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ok, who has a renfest visiting them at this time of year? Interesting thing I''ve noticed, is that there are groups of traveling performers who make a living doing these reniassance fairs. I keep seeing the same performers in photos from fairs all over the US. This woman is a new face to me, however.</td>', 'Ok, who has a renfest visiting them at this time of year? Interesting thing I''ve noticed, is that there are groups of traveling performers who make a living doing these reniassance fairs. I keep seeing the same performers in photos from fairs all over the US. This woman is a new face to me, however.', '2008-11-05 20:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047666, 734933, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting title. She looks a little suspicious of it''s motives.</td>', 'An interesting title. She looks a little suspicious of it''s motives.', '2008-11-05 20:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047671, 732000, 83313, '<td valign="top">This looks like nothing more than good timing and being able to recognize great light when you see it. That''s the point. Nice job.</td>', 'This looks like nothing more than good timing and being able to recognize great light when you see it. That''s the point. Nice job.', '2008-11-05 20:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
