(5048143, 733556, 97166, '<td valign="top">Pete and Willard stood together, staring at the tree.  They both wore identical, ridiculous grins.  They had said it couldn''t be done.  They had said it was impossible.  They had laughed at them for trying.<br/> <br/>With a glance at each other and a whoop of joy, Pete and Willard picked up a couple of wheelbarrows and began the harvest.  A harvest that would see them become richer than their wildest dreams.  The harvest of the world''s first Pumpkin Tree.</td>', 'Pete and Willard stood together, staring at the tree.  They both wore identical, ridiculous grins.  They had said it couldn''t be done.  They had said it was impossible.  They had laughed at them for trying. With a glance at each other and a whoop of joy, Pete and Willard picked up a couple of wheelbarrows and began the harvest.  A harvest that would see them become richer than their wildest dreams.  The harvest of the world''s first Pumpkin Tree.', '2008-11-06 00:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
