(5048534, 735148, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice backlight illuminating a fair part of his outline.  Little bit of motion in the Frisbee, but with his pose it just feels like he was starting to raise that arm to throw it, so it adds some dynamism to the shot.</td>', 'Nice backlight illuminating a fair part of his outline.  Little bit of motion in the Frisbee, but with his pose it just feels like he was starting to raise that arm to throw it, so it adds some dynamism to the shot.', '2008-11-06 09:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
