(5050727, 734947, 98141, '<td valign="top">This pic seems very grainy to me, not very sharp. Also, have to say I don''t find it a very interesting subject, there''s no story or emotion here, just straightforward pic of a light. No creative angle, no creative cropping. Doesn''t make me feel anything, you know?</td>', 'This pic seems very grainy to me, not very sharp. Also, have to say I don''t find it a very interesting subject, there''s no story or emotion here, just straightforward pic of a light. No creative angle, no creative cropping. Doesn''t make me feel anything, you know?', '2008-11-07 13:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
