(5050734, 734493, 98141, '<td valign="top">At the Alhambra I think that there are a myriad of fantastic subjects and photos that you could take. I don''t feel that this is one of them. Such a simple reflection of such a simple portion of the architecture doesn''t do justice to the time, effort, and artistry of that place. Would like this better if something were in focus or not a part of the reflection.</td>', 'At the Alhambra I think that there are a myriad of fantastic subjects and photos that you could take. I don''t feel that this is one of them. Such a simple reflection of such a simple portion of the architecture doesn''t do justice to the time, effort, and artistry of that place. Would like this better if something were in focus or not a part of the reflection.', '2008-11-07 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
