(5051104, 734912, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good potential - wonder about various touch-ups in pp to enhance the image, including cloning out the parked car.</td>', '5 - Good potential - wonder about various touch-ups in pp to enhance the image, including cloning out the parked car.', '2008-11-07 17:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051108, 735248, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Interesting image and my first thought is wondered if the detail lost at this size is there ''wall sized'' - like your composition and the colors, but would like to see a little more detail and/or the high contrast reduced a little, or ''something''.. I like the artistic/painterly ''feel'' to this.</td>', '5 - Interesting image and my first thought is wondered if the detail lost at this size is there ''wall sized'' - like your composition and the colors, but would like to see a little more detail and/or the high contrast reduced a little, or ''something''.. I like the artistic/painterly ''feel'' to this.', '2008-11-07 17:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051112, 733117, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice capture and beautiful colors and scene.  I can''t help but wonder (and this is the second time I''ve looked at this image) about a tighter crop at the top to get an almost mirrored image - but that might just be a personal preference.  Minor, but perhaps cloning out the white/yellow something in the water as it is noticeable on closer inspection and detracts a little, but again - minor.</td>', '8 - Nice capture and beautiful colors and scene.  I can''t help but wonder (and this is the second time I''ve looked at this image) about a tighter crop at the top to get an almost mirrored image - but that might just be a personal preference.  Minor, but perhaps cloning out the white/yellow something in the water as it is noticeable on closer inspection and detracts a little, but again - minor.', '2008-11-07 17:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051113, 735312, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice composition.</td>', '8 - Nice composition.', '2008-11-07 17:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051116, 735285, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Beautiful scene and I like your processing on this (although I imagine a variety of styles would still create a beautiful image) - biggest distraction for me in this image is that it looks (and could just be a visual thing) like it needs a nudge up on the left or perspective correction to ''straighten'' those trees.  A title case for ''rogue'' too - if that matters ...</td>', '8 - Beautiful scene and I like your processing on this (although I imagine a variety of styles would still create a beautiful image) - biggest distraction for me in this image is that it looks (and could just be a visual thing) like it needs a nudge up on the left or perspective correction to ''straighten'' those trees.  A title case for ''rogue'' too - if that matters ...', '2008-11-07 17:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051124, 735181, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Even stronger with a little more off the top, in my opinion (but I like strong symmetry).</td>', '6 - Even stronger with a little more off the top, in my opinion (but I like strong symmetry).', '2008-11-07 17:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051170, 735492, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, and a hint of a sunburst around one of the little holes in the leaf.</td>', 'Nice detail, and a hint of a sunburst around one of the little holes in the leaf.', '2008-11-07 17:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051171, 735409, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for purple ;-)  Lovely detail on the seed caught in the asters.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for purple ;-)  Lovely detail on the seed caught in the asters.', '2008-11-07 17:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051174, 735489, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action.  There is a bit of a glow around the ball that is somewhat alarming, like it''s radioactive, and there appears to be heavy vignetting.</td>', 'Nice stop action.  There is a bit of a glow around the ball that is somewhat alarming, like it''s radioactive, and there appears to be heavy vignetting.', '2008-11-07 17:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051177, 735436, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  I think I would have cropped at the bottom just above the curve heading down to the beak.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  I think I would have cropped at the bottom just above the curve heading down to the beak.', '2008-11-07 17:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051180, 735287, 65234, '<td valign="top">The bird and flag are iconic.  The border is a little overwhelming; I might have used a thin blue border and then white instead of bright red.</td>', 'The bird and flag are iconic.  The border is a little overwhelming; I might have used a thin blue border and then white instead of bright red.', '2008-11-07 17:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051187, 735404, 65234, '<td valign="top">Stunning job on the exposure!  Love the star :-)</td>', 'Stunning job on the exposure!  Love the star :-)', '2008-11-07 17:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051190, 735428, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the slight diagonal to this, and having people on each level.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'Like the slight diagonal to this, and having people on each level.  Interesting shot.', '2008-11-07 18:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051194, 735159, 65234, '<td valign="top">The white church and colorful leaves are a very nice juxtaposition.  I might have cropped tighter on the bottom and I kind of want to see the top of the spire against that lovely blue sky.</td>', 'The white church and colorful leaves are a very nice juxtaposition.  I might have cropped tighter on the bottom and I kind of want to see the top of the spire against that lovely blue sky.', '2008-11-07 18:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051198, 733675, 65234, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit of starburst in his catchlight!  Very cool.  Great detail here, too.</td>', 'There''s a bit of starburst in his catchlight!  Very cool.  Great detail here, too.', '2008-11-07 18:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051200, 733622, 65234, '<td valign="top">:-(  Soft surroundings suit the mood.</td>', ':-(  Soft surroundings suit the mood.', '2008-11-07 18:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051208, 732641, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great spooky tree which looks good against that brooding sky.  Lighting looks a little flat; I might play with dodging the tree some and increasing the contrast to make it even more dramatic.</td>', 'Great spooky tree which looks good against that brooding sky.  Lighting looks a little flat; I might play with dodging the tree some and increasing the contrast to make it even more dramatic.', '2008-11-07 18:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051214, 733740, 92643, '<td valign="top">beautiful!!!! amazing perspective,  i love that you can see the light coming through the clouds and the parasail gives the picture color and interest. Also, the transition of color from top to bottom is very nice!</td>', 'beautiful!!!! amazing perspective,  i love that you can see the light coming through the clouds and the parasail gives the picture color and interest. Also, the transition of color from top to bottom is very nice!', '2008-11-07 18:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051215, 734491, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can see the pupils of his little eyes and the "hairs" on the leaves :-)  I kind of want the shadow of his leg gone or a slightly different angle so the shadow doesn''t line up with the twiggy thing.  Also see a bit of cyan on his upper arm that should probably be browner.</td>', 'I can see the pupils of his little eyes and the "hairs" on the leaves :-)  I kind of want the shadow of his leg gone or a slightly different angle so the shadow doesn''t line up with the twiggy thing.  Also see a bit of cyan on his upper arm that should probably be browner.', '2008-11-07 18:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051217, 733646, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and serene.  Love the detail in the reflections.  I''d crop out the blown sky for a stronger impact from the rest of the image.</td>', 'Very pretty and serene.  Love the detail in the reflections.  I''d crop out the blown sky for a stronger impact from the rest of the image.', '2008-11-07 18:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051221, 730414, 65234, '<td valign="top">Talk about a small focal plane!  Impressive.</td>', 'Talk about a small focal plane!  Impressive.', '2008-11-07 18:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051224, 730075, 70270, '<td valign="top">The scale of this image is just amazing.  Made me stop and look.  Nice job.</td>', 'The scale of this image is just amazing.  Made me stop and look.  Nice job.', '2008-11-07 18:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051226, 735381, 70270, '<td valign="top">great lighting and detail ... well done!</td>', 'great lighting and detail ... well done!', '2008-11-07 18:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051228, 734172, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a perfect face of disbelief ;-)))  The juxtaposition of the dad''s hand and the baby''s is wonderfully warming.</td>', 'What a perfect face of disbelief ;-)))  The juxtaposition of the dad''s hand and the baby''s is wonderfully warming.', '2008-11-07 18:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051230, 732641, 70270, '<td valign="top">dramatic sky; effective processing, good luck</td>', 'dramatic sky; effective processing, good luck', '2008-11-07 18:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051239, 735329, 70270, '<td valign="top">I bet this looks awesome huge; loses some of its impact at 720px</td>', 'I bet this looks awesome huge; loses some of its impact at 720px', '2008-11-07 18:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051243, 735253, 65234, '<td valign="top">I am not ready to see this!!  The vastness of the snow-covered water is wonderful from this angle.</td>', 'I am not ready to see this!!  The vastness of the snow-covered water is wonderful from this angle.', '2008-11-07 18:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051245, 733187, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s walking on a balance beam ;-)  whites appear a bit blown but his focussed expression and the lines here are really nice.</td>', 'Looks like he''s walking on a balance beam ;-)  whites appear a bit blown but his focussed expression and the lines here are really nice.', '2008-11-07 18:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051249, 734328, 65234, '<td valign="top">The detail is amazing!  You must be a brave soul to get this close to a wasp :-)</td>', 'The detail is amazing!  You must be a brave soul to get this close to a wasp :-)', '2008-11-07 18:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051254, 734941, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and exposure.  Crop feels a little off to me, like it needs to be tighter on the right.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and exposure.  Crop feels a little off to me, like it needs to be tighter on the right.', '2008-11-07 18:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051257, 731515, 70270, '<td valign="top">good eye for repeating colors and comp; nice job pulling detail out of the shadowed wall.</td>', 'good eye for repeating colors and comp; nice job pulling detail out of the shadowed wall.', '2008-11-07 18:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051258, 734782, 65234, '<td valign="top">OK, that''s scary ;-)  Wish I''d thought of it when my kids were babies!  B&amp;W and processing are terrific for the title.  I even think the lack of a catchlight in the older child''s eye adds to the surreality of it.</td>', 'OK, that''s scary ;-)  Wish I''d thought of it when my kids were babies!  B&W and processing are terrific for the title.  I even think the lack of a catchlight in the older child''s eye adds to the surreality of it.', '2008-11-07 18:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051262, 733386, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great flight shot :-)  Lost some detail on the closer wing but that Eagle eye and talons are scary-sharp.</td>', 'Great flight shot :-)  Lost some detail on the closer wing but that Eagle eye and talons are scary-sharp.', '2008-11-07 18:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051273, 733322, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - This looks like it might be a natural capture - like the colors, including how the brown in the eyes is enhanced by the surrounds.  Just the off-balance composition (which might be intentional) and, although minor, the rock behind detracts in my opinion.</td>', '6 - This looks like it might be a natural capture - like the colors, including how the brown in the eyes is enhanced by the surrounds.  Just the off-balance composition (which might be intentional) and, although minor, the rock behind detracts in my opinion.', '2008-11-07 18:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051278, 734788, 70270, '<td valign="top">nice foreground/background contrast, like the processing -- looks like a subtle HDR.  good luck</td>', 'nice foreground/background contrast, like the processing -- looks like a subtle HDR.  good luck', '2008-11-07 18:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051279, 735312, 70270, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors, beautiful processing ... good luck</td>', 'Stunning colors, beautiful processing ... good luck', '2008-11-07 18:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051280, 735158, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely butterflies, and they look so very delicate here.  Love the fade to creamy white in the background, too, as it echoes the butterflies'' color while their black outlines are in crisp contrast to it.  They look almost like cartoon butterflies, which is not a style I usually like but it works here.</td>', 'Lovely butterflies, and they look so very delicate here.  Love the fade to creamy white in the background, too, as it echoes the butterflies'' color while their black outlines are in crisp contrast to it.  They look almost like cartoon butterflies, which is not a style I usually like but it works here.', '2008-11-07 18:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051282, 731879, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and a bit unusual.  good luck</td>', 'Nice detail and a bit unusual.  good luck', '2008-11-07 18:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051283, 730972, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nicely done, although it does look like it needs a slight perspective correction.  Shame the clouds didn''t oblige you with a more balanced backdrop - but having said that they do ''bleed'' out into the taller area of the image... who knows.  Which leads me to inspect the overall balance closer..  Like your title.</td>', '7 - Nicely done, although it does look like it needs a slight perspective correction.  Shame the clouds didn''t oblige you with a more balanced backdrop - but having said that they do ''bleed'' out into the taller area of the image... who knows.  Which leads me to inspect the overall balance closer..  Like your title.', '2008-11-07 18:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051285, 735175, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ack!  Congratulations; you made me dizzy (or dizzier than I was a moment ago, anyway).</td>', 'Ack!  Congratulations; you made me dizzy (or dizzier than I was a moment ago, anyway).', '2008-11-07 18:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051288, 735295, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks wonderfully isolated.  The light-to-dark progression through the image is just lovely.</td>', 'Looks wonderfully isolated.  The light-to-dark progression through the image is just lovely.', '2008-11-07 18:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051296, 729260, 65234, '<td valign="top">Is that the baby again?  Dang, he''s cute :-)  I don''t know if he looks happy, exactly, but certainly superior to the likes of us!</td>', 'Is that the baby again?  Dang, he''s cute :-)  I don''t know if he looks happy, exactly, but certainly superior to the likes of us!', '2008-11-07 18:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051300, 734867, 65234, '<td valign="top">I had to study it for a minute to see what I have to assume is an egg (or an aphid).  However did you luck onto such a thing?!  Great, great detail on those ants.</td>', 'I had to study it for a minute to see what I have to assume is an egg (or an aphid).  However did you luck onto such a thing?!  Great, great detail on those ants.', '2008-11-07 18:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051302, 734793, 65234, '<td valign="top">I love how warm the sun is as it enters the cold landscape.  Very well done :-)</td>', 'I love how warm the sun is as it enters the cold landscape.  Very well done :-)', '2008-11-07 18:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051303, 732660, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great sense of motion here; perfect exposure for the scene.</td>', 'Great sense of motion here; perfect exposure for the scene.', '2008-11-07 18:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051306, 734209, 65234, '<td valign="top">All ready for takeoff, I see.  Looks like a milkweedy plant.  There''s more order in the seeds than I realized.</td>', 'All ready for takeoff, I see.  Looks like a milkweedy plant.  There''s more order in the seeds than I realized.', '2008-11-07 18:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051308, 735034, 65234, '<td valign="top">This looks like the kind of shot that would drive me nuts, trying to get it perfectly symmetrical.  You did an impressive job of that :-)</td>', 'This looks like the kind of shot that would drive me nuts, trying to get it perfectly symmetrical.  You did an impressive job of that :-)', '2008-11-07 18:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051310, 734313, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great perspective :-)  These guys look so much like little aliens, and you can''t miss the "face" here.</td>', 'Great perspective :-)  These guys look so much like little aliens, and you can''t miss the "face" here.', '2008-11-07 18:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051316, 728472, 65234, '<td valign="top">Majestic dogs.  I like the lighting, but I think he needed to have his head turned a little more towards the camera so we could see the other eye (assuming there is one) or turned farther away in profile.</td>', 'Majestic dogs.  I like the lighting, but I think he needed to have his head turned a little more towards the camera so we could see the other eye (assuming there is one) or turned farther away in profile.', '2008-11-07 18:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051324, 735262, 70270, '<td valign="top">cool pick, nice set up, edgy processing works well here</td>', 'cool pick, nice set up, edgy processing works well here', '2008-11-07 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051325, 733556, 70270, '<td valign="top">nice simple composition, wonderful colors, good luck</td>', 'nice simple composition, wonderful colors, good luck', '2008-11-07 18:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051327, 735258, 70270, '<td valign="top">love the colors and forms; one of my favorites this month.  You should check out Dewitt Jones column in the current issue of Outdoor Photographer.</td>', 'love the colors and forms; one of my favorites this month.  You should check out Dewitt Jones column in the current issue of Outdoor Photographer.', '2008-11-07 18:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051328, 733099, 70270, '<td valign="top">love the rich colors and tones here</td>', 'love the rich colors and tones here', '2008-11-07 18:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051331, 735046, 70270, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and detail, but the background is what really makes this pop.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great sharpness and detail, but the background is what really makes this pop.  Good luck.', '2008-11-07 18:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051332, 735344, 70270, '<td valign="top">ho hum, another stunning shot from Iceland.  :&gt;)  Love the foreground lighting.  9</td>', 'ho hum, another stunning shot from Iceland.  :>)  Love the foreground lighting.  9', '2008-11-07 18:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051334, 735391, 70270, '<td valign="top">Keep coming back to this one; interesting seen, nicely composed and processed.  bumping again to a 10</td>', 'Keep coming back to this one; interesting seen, nicely composed and processed.  bumping again to a 10', '2008-11-07 18:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051335, 735163, 70270, '<td valign="top">simply effective.  love the blue tones</td>', 'simply effective.  love the blue tones', '2008-11-07 18:55:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5051336, 734268, 70270, '<td valign="top">excellent motion blur ... would have been the best in that challenge, and one of the best here too.  10</td>', 'excellent motion blur ... would have been the best in that challenge, and one of the best here too.  10', '2008-11-07 18:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051339, 727994, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks weirdly double-jointed ;-)  And almost like she''s batting her little eyes at me.</td>', 'Looks weirdly double-jointed ;-)  And almost like she''s batting her little eyes at me.', '2008-11-07 18:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051357, 735282, 83313, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little too much of that golden glow keeps it from standing out against the background. Might be able to make some selective adjustments to get the buck to stand out better.</td>', 'Maybe a little too much of that golden glow keeps it from standing out against the background. Might be able to make some selective adjustments to get the buck to stand out better.', '2008-11-07 19:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051373, 735096, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not the kind of shot I normally expect to see in a challenge on this site. Pretty decent for what it is. Well composed, decently lit. My eye is guided right up to the store''s name. If I had hired you to do a good shot of this store for an advertisement, I would be pleased. If I were an overly picky and anal DPC member, I might have bumped up the curves, saturation and contrast just a wee bit to give it a little more visual impact. Good thing that''s not the case...<br/> <br/>Actually, the more I look at this, the more I think you''ve done a good job with a relatively ordinary subject. A type of shot that is bread and butter for many professional photogs.</td>', 'Not the kind of shot I normally expect to see in a challenge on this site. Pretty decent for what it is. Well composed, decently lit. My eye is guided right up to the store''s name. If I had hired you to do a good shot of this store for an advertisement, I would be pleased. If I were an overly picky and anal DPC member, I might have bumped up the curves, saturation and contrast just a wee bit to give it a little more visual impact. Good thing that''s not the case... Actually, the more I look at this, the more I think you''ve done a good job with a relatively ordinary subject. A type of shot that is bread and butter for many professional photogs.', '2008-11-07 19:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051375, 735108, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but you got some wonderful smooth tones in this.</td>', 'A little dark, but you got some wonderful smooth tones in this.', '2008-11-07 19:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051378, 735296, 83313, '<td valign="top">Don''t eat it Snow White!! It''s leftover from the Brothers Grimm challenge and is probably rotten by now!</td>', 'Don''t eat it Snow White!! It''s leftover from the Brothers Grimm challenge and is probably rotten by now!', '2008-11-07 19:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051382, 731511, 83313, '<td valign="top">Catching this bird may have been just blind luck, or there may have been a bunch flocking. Either way, this works well for me.</td>', 'Catching this bird may have been just blind luck, or there may have been a bunch flocking. Either way, this works well for me.', '2008-11-07 19:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051386, 734890, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better portraits I''ve seen. Very creative DOF and fabulous tones/light.</td>', 'This is one of the better portraits I''ve seen. Very creative DOF and fabulous tones/light.', '2008-11-07 19:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051388, 728492, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see an awful lot of artifacting in this image. The file size itself it normal, but the image itself looks like it was either oversharpened or saved with excessive compression at some previous point.</td>', 'I see an awful lot of artifacting in this image. The file size itself it normal, but the image itself looks like it was either oversharpened or saved with excessive compression at some previous point.', '2008-11-07 19:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051390, 734508, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m fond of this frond.</td>', 'I''m fond of this frond.', '2008-11-07 19:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051399, 727994, 83313, '<td valign="top">These things are soooo cool. I''m amazed at the variations in colors these seem to have. I got a similarly detailed shot of a nice bright blue one recently.</td>', 'These things are soooo cool. I''m amazed at the variations in colors these seem to have. I got a similarly detailed shot of a nice bright blue one recently.', '2008-11-07 19:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051405, 735300, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit bright and oversaturated to me. Something just doesn''t look right to me, but I''m not totally sure what it is. Perhaps this one has just too much detail to fit into 720 pixels.</td>', 'Seems a bit bright and oversaturated to me. Something just doesn''t look right to me, but I''m not totally sure what it is. Perhaps this one has just too much detail to fit into 720 pixels.', '2008-11-07 19:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051410, 728064, 83313, '<td valign="top">One of the nicest deer shots I''ve seen in this freestudy. Wonderful tones, and the deer really stands out against the background.</td>', 'One of the nicest deer shots I''ve seen in this freestudy. Wonderful tones, and the deer really stands out against the background.', '2008-11-07 19:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051411, 731697, 92864, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.', '2008-11-07 19:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051414, 733940, 92864, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2008-11-07 19:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051420, 735329, 83313, '<td valign="top">I know it''s tonemapped HDR, and that''s what it''s supposed to look like when done that way, but it looks a bit too much unnatural to me. It''s actually a pretty good image, I may just be getting to the point where the "wow" look of HDR is not bowling me over anymore. My own entry is a little unnatural looking, so I am most certainly the pot calling the kettle black.  I''ll be curious to see where this one comes in.</td>', 'I know it''s tonemapped HDR, and that''s what it''s supposed to look like when done that way, but it looks a bit too much unnatural to me. It''s actually a pretty good image, I may just be getting to the point where the "wow" look of HDR is not bowling me over anymore. My own entry is a little unnatural looking, so I am most certainly the pot calling the kettle black.  I''ll be curious to see where this one comes in.', '2008-11-07 19:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051422, 733478, 83313, '<td valign="top">An awesome sunset, which on DPC is normal ops.</td>', 'An awesome sunset, which on DPC is normal ops.', '2008-11-07 19:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051429, 734447, 83313, '<td valign="top">The brightness of the leaf seems to overpower the water drops, which would stand out more if this were processed differently. I think downplaying the water drops may cost you points. After all, water drops are a standard high score prop on DPC. I like it however, and I am pleased that you played up the background texture instead of the drops.</td>', 'The brightness of the leaf seems to overpower the water drops, which would stand out more if this were processed differently. I think downplaying the water drops may cost you points. After all, water drops are a standard high score prop on DPC. I like it however, and I am pleased that you played up the background texture instead of the drops.', '2008-11-07 19:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051441, 733213, 92864, '<td valign="top">Great! One of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Great! One of my favorites of the challenge.', '2008-11-07 19:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051461, 735163, 89940, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, it really grabs me. 10</td>', 'This is beautiful, it really grabs me. 10', '2008-11-07 20:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
