(5051480, 734331, 90495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image of this bird frozen in time like that. Although I would have liked to have a better look at his face I appreciate the moment caught from nature. My only nit is the whites of your bird aren''t white at all. Upping the levels just a bit would have given this that extra punch appeal with a bright white bird coming out from the dark bg.<br/> <br/>Wouldn''t mind seeing this with a few minor adjustments after the voting.</td>', 'Beautiful image of this bird frozen in time like that. Although I would have liked to have a better look at his face I appreciate the moment caught from nature. My only nit is the whites of your bird aren''t white at all. Upping the levels just a bit would have given this that extra punch appeal with a bright white bird coming out from the dark bg. Wouldn''t mind seeing this with a few minor adjustments after the voting.', '2008-11-07 20:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
