(5051613, 733228, 97166, '<td valign="top">Carl hammered out the final notes in his set to the thunderous roar of the crowd.  He''d put on a performance that was unlike any other.  He''d hit every note. He''d slammed every whammy.  He''d nailed every bridge.<br/> <br/>With a final twang, the song was done and he raised his arms in victory. The crowd went wild, and he knew that a new contract was his.  <br/> <br/>He looked at the screen.  100%.  YOU ROCK! you shouted at him silently.<br/> <br/>He was a Guitar Hero God.</td>', 'Carl hammered out the final notes in his set to the thunderous roar of the crowd.  He''d put on a performance that was unlike any other.  He''d hit every note. He''d slammed every whammy.  He''d nailed every bridge. With a final twang, the song was done and he raised his arms in victory. The crowd went wild, and he knew that a new contract was his.   He looked at the screen.  100%.  YOU ROCK! you shouted at him silently. He was a Guitar Hero God.', '2008-11-07 21:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051614, 734964, 97166, '<td valign="top">She''d never had a request like this before, but it thrilled her a little bit, and so she tried it.  Placing the petals over her eyes as instructed, she puckered her lips for a kiss, and screamed in surprise as the puppy licked her face emphatically.<br/> <br/>She jumped up with a laugh and punched her boyfriend on the arm.  Laughing, he showed her the gorgeous little Husky pup, a pup she''d wanted for years.  He was allergic, but his love for her was strong he said, and he only wanted her to be as happy as she could be.<br/> <br/>Later that night, puppy safely in another room, the petals were put to another purpose.</td>', 'She''d never had a request like this before, but it thrilled her a little bit, and so she tried it.  Placing the petals over her eyes as instructed, she puckered her lips for a kiss, and screamed in surprise as the puppy licked her face emphatically. She jumped up with a laugh and punched her boyfriend on the arm.  Laughing, he showed her the gorgeous little Husky pup, a pup she''d wanted for years.  He was allergic, but his love for her was strong he said, and he only wanted her to be as happy as she could be. Later that night, puppy safely in another room, the petals were put to another purpose.', '2008-11-07 21:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051616, 734895, 97166, '<td valign="top">He wasn''t grinning this time.  This time it was the last straw. This time The Batman had gone too far.  <br/> <br/>In a tragic twist of fate, The Batman had somehow discovered a cure for him.  He''d healed his scars, mended his mind, cured his insanity, and he had done it all WITHOUT HIS PERMISSION!<br/> <br/>He glared at the TV showing news reports of the success of Batman''s work, and then slowly smeared lipstick on his face, attempting to regain a part of his old self once again.   He tried hard.  He thought of the worst possible thoughts he could.  He attempted to conjure up images of death and murder and horrific things.<br/> <br/>He couldn''t.  <br/> <br/>Sighing, he put down the lipstick and washed all the makeup off his face.  Then he clicked the remote, turned off the TV, and went to his new day job at the local KFC.</td>', 'He wasn''t grinning this time.  This time it was the last straw. This time The Batman had gone too far.   In a tragic twist of fate, The Batman had somehow discovered a cure for him.  He''d healed his scars, mended his mind, cured his insanity, and he had done it all WITHOUT HIS PERMISSION! He glared at the TV showing news reports of the success of Batman''s work, and then slowly smeared lipstick on his face, attempting to regain a part of his old self once again.   He tried hard.  He thought of the worst possible thoughts he could.  He attempted to conjure up images of death and murder and horrific things. He couldn''t.   Sighing, he put down the lipstick and washed all the makeup off his face.  Then he clicked the remote, turned off the TV, and went to his new day job at the local KFC.', '2008-11-07 21:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051619, 734966, 97166, '<td valign="top">It was glorious and magnificent, mankind''s achievements.  We built and created and glorified. More and more. Bigger, taller, faster, brighter.  Always we strived for more.  Always we strived to out-do everything that came before.<br/> <br/>We thought we would continue infinitely.  Until they came.<br/> <br/>We were wrong.</td>', 'It was glorious and magnificent, mankind''s achievements.  We built and created and glorified. More and more. Bigger, taller, faster, brighter.  Always we strived for more.  Always we strived to out-do everything that came before. We thought we would continue infinitely.  Until they came. We were wrong.', '2008-11-07 21:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
