(5051979, 732395, 83080, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Oded:</b></div><hr/><i> I admire the knowledge &amp; technicality it takes to make such shots,<br/>yet I find they say or mean nothing to me </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I feel just the opposite (about the meaning part).  Just like sunrises, landscapes, and even people, water drops can look very boring and mean nothing, or, with creativity, they can convey something special.  This clearly took some creative effort along with the technicality and it says a fair bit more than just "drip, drip".  Congratulations on a well executed photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-08 02:05:24.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Oded: I admire the knowledge & technicality it takes to make such shots,yet I find they say or mean nothing to me  I feel just the opposite (about the meaning part).  Just like sunrises, landscapes, and even people, water drops can look very boring and mean nothing, or, with creativity, they can convey something special.  This clearly took some creative effort along with the technicality and it says a fair bit more than just "drip, drip".  Congratulations on a well executed photo.', '2008-11-08 02:04:44.000000', '2008-11-08 02:05:24.000000', 0),
