(5052340, 735163, 61012, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Karen, beautiful shot!</td>', 'Congratulations Karen, beautiful shot!', '2008-11-08 10:46:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052348, 734268, 53094, '<td valign="top">Amazing...just simply an amazing photograph!  Congratulations, Sandy on such a stunning image, and great Free Study finish.</td>', 'Amazing...just simply an amazing photograph!  Congratulations, Sandy on such a stunning image, and great Free Study finish.', '2008-11-08 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052363, 734856, 37845, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the decent finish (think you should have scored higher still, but what is my opinion worth ;) ) <br/> <br/>Also, we both got a post luminous award nomination in this challenge....I knew we would both be honoured in the same challenge at some point :D</td>', 'Congrats on the decent finish (think you should have scored higher still, but what is my opinion worth ;) )  Also, we both got a post luminous award nomination in this challenge....I knew we would both be honoured in the same challenge at some point :D', '2008-11-08 11:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052369, 734909, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue!!  You got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue!!  You got a 7 from me.', '2008-11-08 11:19:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052389, 733386, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy!  These voters must be just so de-sensitized to majestic photography.  This is a National Geographic magazine feature photo.  I''d think I''d died and gone to heaven to see an eagle out and about in the wild like this -- but then to capture such detail in a photograph.  6.3 is quite an understatement of this photo!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmy!  These voters must be just so de-sensitized to majestic photography.  This is a National Geographic magazine feature photo.  I''d think I''d died and gone to heaven to see an eagle out and about in the wild like this -- but then to capture such detail in a photograph.  6.3 is quite an understatement of this photo! ', '2008-11-08 11:39:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052391, 735479, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, Anni!!  I love this!   Is that your neighborhood?  It looks straight off a Norman Rockwell painting :)   What a moment captured -- then processed to make it even better :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, Anni!!  I love this!   Is that your neighborhood?  It looks straight off a Norman Rockwell painting :)   What a moment captured -- then processed to make it even better :) ', '2008-11-08 11:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052394, 734121, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh. . .Butter is BEEEEAUTIFUL!  He jumps off the page at you!   I think he was indeed a gift.  I am so sorry for the loss of your beagle.  After a year, does it still hurt?   I lost my cocker spaniel just a bit over a month ago, and I still cry for her every day.   I''m starting to wonder if I will ever be able to not cry when I think of her.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohhhh. . .Butter is BEEEEAUTIFUL!  He jumps off the page at you!   I think he was indeed a gift.  I am so sorry for the loss of your beagle.  After a year, does it still hurt?   I lost my cocker spaniel just a bit over a month ago, and I still cry for her every day.   I''m starting to wonder if I will ever be able to not cry when I think of her. ', '2008-11-08 11:43:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052399, 735116, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think this is beautiful!  I think of our 4-year old, Abby, and she would N-E-V-E-R pose for us like this.   I think she did a fabulous job.  She certainly makes autumn look even more captivating than it already does :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I think this is beautiful!  I think of our 4-year old, Abby, and she would N-E-V-E-R pose for us like this.   I think she did a fabulous job.  She certainly makes autumn look even more captivating than it already does :) ', '2008-11-08 11:48:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052400, 735163, 14986, '<td valign="top">Karen,<br/> <br/>Wow...beautiful shot.  Inspires me to go out and try something similar.  This is really done well and I''ll be will print up to a spectacular photo.  Great shot to get your ribbon and PB!  Congratulations.</td>', 'Karen, Wow...beautiful shot.  Inspires me to go out and try something similar.  This is really done well and I''ll be will print up to a spectacular photo.  Great shot to get your ribbon and PB!  Congratulations.', '2008-11-08 11:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052401, 734209, 24454, '<td valign="top">Those plants are so photogenic. . .with the right photographer''s touch :)   This is really pretty!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Those plants are so photogenic. . .with the right photographer''s touch :)   This is really pretty! ', '2008-11-08 11:50:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052403, 732310, 24454, '<td valign="top">Auuuugh. . how beautiful this scene is!  I am imagining all the autumn colors blanketing that water to make such vivid reflections.</td>', 'Auuuugh. . how beautiful this scene is!  I am imagining all the autumn colors blanketing that water to make such vivid reflections.', '2008-11-08 11:51:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052405, 728813, 86336, '<td valign="top">WTG Andrew.  Well Done</td>', 'WTG Andrew.  Well Done', '2008-11-08 11:53:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052406, 735192, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  I love the human element to give that wistful, peaceful sense of awe one gets while sitting by the ocean with its breeze, and the sounds.   What a great photo.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is wonderful.  I love the human element to give that wistful, peaceful sense of awe one gets while sitting by the ocean with its breeze, and the sounds.   What a great photo. ', '2008-11-08 11:54:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052409, 732258, 24454, '<td valign="top">Jeffrey!  THIS. . .is AWESOME!   Have you opened your Washington DC gallery yet?   You''d have to quit your day job to handle all the money that would roll in :)   Your photography of those striking places there is something to behold.</td>', 'Jeffrey!  THIS. . .is AWESOME!   Have you opened your Washington DC gallery yet?   You''d have to quit your day job to handle all the money that would roll in :)   Your photography of those striking places there is something to behold.', '2008-11-08 11:56:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052410, 735472, 76335, '<td valign="top">The challenge with shots like this is that it''s so easy to ruin the background in post-processing. My experience anyway. Here you''ve done an excellent job maintaining all the subtle things that make this work. Great bokeh, minimalism, negative space, use of thirds, colors, composition, etc. etc. Nice job!</td>', 'The challenge with shots like this is that it''s so easy to ruin the background in post-processing. My experience anyway. Here you''ve done an excellent job maintaining all the subtle things that make this work. Great bokeh, minimalism, negative space, use of thirds, colors, composition, etc. etc. Nice job!', '2008-11-08 11:57:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052412, 734848, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ok.  I am SERIOUSLY protesting a 5.8 for this photo!   This is the one I want to hang on my wall.   Is it up for prints yet????    I''m going to go look for it.  I want it.   <br/> <br/></td>', 'Ok.  I am SERIOUSLY protesting a 5.8 for this photo!   This is the one I want to hang on my wall.   Is it up for prints yet????    I''m going to go look for it.  I want it.    ', '2008-11-08 11:57:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052413, 734829, 67697, '<td valign="top">oooh, i like.  Dark, moody, and soft.  Definitely a european feel to the picture.  Such a stark contrast to the bright, crisp architecture shots you had in Japan.</td>', 'oooh, i like.  Dark, moody, and soft.  Definitely a european feel to the picture.  Such a stark contrast to the bright, crisp architecture shots you had in Japan.', '2008-11-08 11:58:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052416, 735330, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow, Jeb!  I''ve never seen farming look so strikingly beautiful.   But I can imagine moments like this make a farmer know they could never do anything else.   <br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow, Jeb!  I''ve never seen farming look so strikingly beautiful.   But I can imagine moments like this make a farmer know they could never do anything else.    ', '2008-11-08 11:59:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052418, 734999, 24454, '<td valign="top">:)!  This is a cute capture.   Man.  They are BRUTAL in free study voting sometimes.  This is much better than the 5.2 it received!<br/> <br/></td>', ':)!  This is a cute capture.   Man.  They are BRUTAL in free study voting sometimes.  This is much better than the 5.2 it received! ', '2008-11-08 12:01:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052421, 733539, 6519, '<td valign="top">Wtg Rob, that is just lovely! Congrats on the ribbon.<br/> <br/>Do tell - exactly where IS this spot?<br/> <br/>My favorite fog spot driving down the hill towards Maple Valley Highway is too full of power lines etc. My eyes and brain can ignore all the distractions, but I know that a photo wouldn''t :-(</td>', 'Wtg Rob, that is just lovely! Congrats on the ribbon. Do tell - exactly where IS this spot? My favorite fog spot driving down the hill towards Maple Valley Highway is too full of power lines etc. My eyes and brain can ignore all the distractions, but I know that a photo wouldn''t :-(', '2008-11-08 12:02:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052422, 735379, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ok, so what''s the October project?  The reds are gorgeous.  I did want to see more clarity on the ones on the bottom because they are so interesting looking!  Pretty contrast against the concrete.</td>', 'Ok, so what''s the October project?  The reds are gorgeous.  I did want to see more clarity on the ones on the bottom because they are so interesting looking!  Pretty contrast against the concrete.', '2008-11-08 12:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052426, 729260, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww, LYDIA!  I LOVE THIS!  I think Turtles are about the coolest animals to photograph.  They so often have smiles on their faces, don''t they?  He just looks downright adorable!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Awwwwww, LYDIA!  I LOVE THIS!  I think Turtles are about the coolest animals to photograph.  They so often have smiles on their faces, don''t they?  He just looks downright adorable! ', '2008-11-08 12:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
