(5052476, 733386, 19936, '<td valign="top">Thanks Sandy and all the rest of the commenters.  I was lucky to get a few usable shots of this eagle as it flew off a telephone pole.  Most came out with wires and the pole in them.  I entered a very similar one in the wildlife challenge and it scored 6.8 so I suspect people knocked this one down due to lack of originality.  <br/> <br/>maxxumg - this was in the wild as I live in an area that has quite a few eagles.  I was able to stop, get out of my car and walk pretty close to the pole he was on.  The problem is gettng them with a good background and keeping signs of man out.  This was in a river delta made up of many farms.  I go there often as it is full of raptors.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-08 15:29:30.</i></td>', 'Thanks Sandy and all the rest of the commenters.  I was lucky to get a few usable shots of this eagle as it flew off a telephone pole.  Most came out with wires and the pole in them.  I entered a very similar one in the wildlife challenge and it scored 6.8 so I suspect people knocked this one down due to lack of originality.   maxxumg - this was in the wild as I live in an area that has quite a few eagles.  I was able to stop, get out of my car and walk pretty close to the pole he was on.  The problem is gettng them with a good background and keeping signs of man out.  This was in a river delta made up of many farms.  I go there often as it is full of raptors.  ', '2008-11-08 12:57:12.000000', '2008-11-08 15:29:30.000000', 0),
(5052478, 731751, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wow! David, you would have been crazy not to enter this (thank goodness you were threatened ;-) I can''t get over these colors, in fact, the whole thing is breathtaking. Many congrats on your excellent 13th place.</td>', 'Wow! David, you would have been crazy not to enter this (thank goodness you were threatened ;-) I can''t get over these colors, in fact, the whole thing is breathtaking. Many congrats on your excellent 13th place.', '2008-11-08 12:59:16.000000', NULL, 0),
