(5052494, 732395, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JMart:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Oded:</b></div><hr/><i> I admire the knowledge &amp; technicality it takes to make such shots,<br/>yet I find they say or mean nothing to me </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I feel just the opposite (about the meaning part).  Just like sunrises, landscapes, and even people, water drops can look very boring and mean nothing, or, with creativity, they can convey something special.  This clearly took some creative effort along with the technicality and it says a fair bit more than just "drip, drip".  Congratulations on a well executed photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I agree, absolutely. A lot of work went into the making of this and the result is well worth looking at.<br/>Brian, you would probably have won the Red III challenge with this ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by JMart: Originally posted by Oded: I admire the knowledge & technicality it takes to make such shots,yet I find they say or mean nothing to me  I feel just the opposite (about the meaning part).  Just like sunrises, landscapes, and even people, water drops can look very boring and mean nothing, or, with creativity, they can convey something special.  This clearly took some creative effort along with the technicality and it says a fair bit more than just "drip, drip".  Congratulations on a well executed photo.  I agree, absolutely. A lot of work went into the making of this and the result is well worth looking at.Brian, you would probably have won the Red III challenge with this ;-)', '2008-11-08 13:13:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5052505, 735344, 89230, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! My favorite of the challenge. Unfortunate that others thought this was anything less than a 6! Stupid Trollers!!!!   +Favorite</td>', 'I love this photo! My favorite of the challenge. Unfortunate that others thought this was anything less than a 6! Stupid Trollers!!!!   +Favorite', '2008-11-08 13:18:10.000000', NULL, 0),
