(5054433, 734121, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful boy!  Lovely picture of him, too, by the way - color is rich, comp is good - all that stuff.  But then I''m a sucker for kitty portraits.  And yes, you''ve learned that we don''t choose cats, they choose us.  Butter chose well.  :-)</td>', 'What a beautiful boy!  Lovely picture of him, too, by the way - color is rich, comp is good - all that stuff.  But then I''m a sucker for kitty portraits.  And yes, you''ve learned that we don''t choose cats, they choose us.  Butter chose well.  :-)', '2008-11-10 01:12:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5054443, 735248, 30982, '<td valign="top">The heron is not too small.  It is, in fact, just right for the splendor of the setting, and I love that his is the only reflection.  Lovely.</td>', 'The heron is not too small.  It is, in fact, just right for the splendor of the setting, and I love that his is the only reflection.  Lovely.', '2008-11-10 01:23:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5054452, 728064, 30982, '<td valign="top">Talk about "natural habitats" - great shot to start with, but what I like about it is the way it shows how well these guys blend with their surroundings.  The setting you caught him in is just perfect.</td>', 'Talk about "natural habitats" - great shot to start with, but what I like about it is the way it shows how well these guys blend with their surroundings.  The setting you caught him in is just perfect.', '2008-11-10 01:32:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5054475, 735163, 30214, '<td valign="top">beautiful Karen congratulations :)</td>', 'beautiful Karen congratulations :)', '2008-11-10 02:01:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5054494, 735380, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely B&amp;W study - great detail and range of tones in this.  Beautifully edited.  Quiet, peaceful.</td>', 'A lovely B&W study - great detail and range of tones in this.  Beautifully edited.  Quiet, peaceful.', '2008-11-10 02:47:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5054503, 735130, 37430, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!!! This is very creative. Would really like to know what all post-processing went into this.</td>', 'Congratulations!!! This is very creative. Would really like to know what all post-processing went into this.', '2008-11-10 02:56:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5054595, 734888, 30982, '<td valign="top">Tis a magnificent view you''ve given us - all the more splendid that it is in B&amp;W as it adds that nice timeless feel.  For monitors that are too dark (one of mine is) the detail in the main land mass is hard to distinguish.  On my other monitor, however, it is spot on.  The water is splendiforous in it''s luminosity, and the skyline so nicely encased in the bridge is highlighted by those awesome and very cooperative clouds.  Sadly, the DPC limitation also limits the grandness of this view.  This is one of those that really needs to be printed and viewed much larger than monitors permit.</td>', 'Tis a magnificent view you''ve given us - all the more splendid that it is in B&W as it adds that nice timeless feel.  For monitors that are too dark (one of mine is) the detail in the main land mass is hard to distinguish.  On my other monitor, however, it is spot on.  The water is splendiforous in it''s luminosity, and the skyline so nicely encased in the bridge is highlighted by those awesome and very cooperative clouds.  Sadly, the DPC limitation also limits the grandness of this view.  This is one of those that really needs to be printed and viewed much larger than monitors permit.', '2008-11-10 06:16:28.000000', NULL, 0),
