(5056365, 734848, 48228, '<td valign="top">Definitely deserved a higher score for this wonderful ''foggy'' autumn collection of nature.....<br/> <br/>I cannot get this out of my mind as I can see it written in a fairytale movie script or fairytale book..... A feeling of peace and tranquility with a palette of autumn colors.....<br/> <br/>Definitely a favorite..... love mshez<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-11 08:03:30.</i></td>', 'Definitely deserved a higher score for this wonderful ''foggy'' autumn collection of nature..... I cannot get this out of my mind as I can see it written in a fairytale movie script or fairytale book..... A feeling of peace and tranquility with a palette of autumn colors..... Definitely a favorite..... love mshez', '2008-11-11 07:59:32.000000', '2008-11-11 08:03:30.000000', 0),
