(5081337, 734789, 97852, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  There''s no way this one should''ve ended up this far from the front.  It is very well composed, focus is dead on with perfect depth of field, great colors, just beautiful!  I want you to know I gave you a 9 in voting.  I voted on all of them and I typically don''t give many 9''s or 10''s for that matter but you definitely deserved a better finish.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I love this shot.  There''s no way this one should''ve ended up this far from the front.  It is very well composed, focus is dead on with perfect depth of field, great colors, just beautiful!  I want you to know I gave you a 9 in voting.  I voted on all of them and I typically don''t give many 9''s or 10''s for that matter but you definitely deserved a better finish.  Keep up the good work.', '2008-11-24 09:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5081846, 735192, 30982, '<td valign="top">Just saw the comment about the tire prints - I think they''re perfect here.  They add another horizontal texture to go with the wet line (which looks to have footprints), the water line, the foam, the waves.  And the red and her perfect pose create an element of order, of calm.  A beautiful shot!</td>', 'Just saw the comment about the tire prints - I think they''re perfect here.  They add another horizontal texture to go with the wet line (which looks to have footprints), the water line, the foam, the waves.  And the red and her perfect pose create an element of order, of calm.  A beautiful shot!', '2008-11-24 15:10:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5081853, 732602, 30982, '<td valign="top">I could have sworn I commented on this - perhaps it was in your portfolio earlier?  How can people so woefully underappreciate a gorgeous photograph of Ents?</td>', 'I could have sworn I commented on this - perhaps it was in your portfolio earlier?  How can people so woefully underappreciate a gorgeous photograph of Ents?', '2008-11-24 15:14:26.000000', NULL, 0),
