(5455713, 734268, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sandy,<br/> <br/>This might seem forward of me, but as a newbie, I like to look at the portfolios of people on the forum threads as a way to get a feel for who is participating here and what is generally being produced.<br/> <br/>First of all, your images are stunning and beautiful - incredible work. I don''t understand how you haven''t walked away with more ribbons from some of the challenge entries.<br/> <br/>Second, I wonder if you would mind if I pointed my high school and college art/photography students at this particulr image "Two by Light" as an example of the perfect blend of art as/and photography? It is simply gorgeous, perfectly framed and captured with every aspect well controlled and presented - an explosion of grace and beauty.<br/> <br/>Third - might it be possible to obtain a print? :&gt;)<br/> <br/>Fourth - have you considered doing a gallery showing? I have a good friend in San Antonio who has very strong connections to the art community there and I''d be glad to point him to this site, and your own website and see if he could help set something up.<br/> <br/>Great body of work - something that I don''t have the patience or eye for even after 50 some odd years of photographing the world around me.<br/> <br/>Take care - all the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>Later,<br/> <br/>Tom</td>', 'Sandy, This might seem forward of me, but as a newbie, I like to look at the portfolios of people on the forum threads as a way to get a feel for who is participating here and what is generally being produced. First of all, your images are stunning and beautiful - incredible work. I don''t understand how you haven''t walked away with more ribbons from some of the challenge entries. Second, I wonder if you would mind if I pointed my high school and college art/photography students at this particulr image "Two by Light" as an example of the perfect blend of art as/and photography? It is simply gorgeous, perfectly framed and captured with every aspect well controlled and presented - an explosion of grace and beauty. Third - might it be possible to obtain a print? :>) Fourth - have you considered doing a gallery showing? I have a good friend in San Antonio who has very strong connections to the art community there and I''d be glad to point him to this site, and your own website and see if he could help set something up. Great body of work - something that I don''t have the patience or eye for even after 50 some odd years of photographing the world around me. Take care - all the best to you and yours. Later, Tom', '2009-04-28 15:20:07.000000', NULL, 0),
